From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: John Kleinschmidt <jkleinsc@electronjs.org>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 19:30:20 +0000
Subject: chore: add .yarnrc.yml and yarn.lock file to use yarn v4

Electron installs nan's test dependencies with yarn 4, whose immutable and
hardened installs on CI need a lockfile to check against; nan does not ship
one.

diff --git a/.yarnrc.yml b/.yarnrc.yml
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..3186f3f0795ab612d5508593672dc9ad94bccca0
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.yarnrc.yml
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+nodeLinker: node-modules
